<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-juke-joint-slide" category="Crunch" order="80" instrument="guitar" style="Slide Blues">
  <description>Gritty, open slide tone: a small class-A combo dimed and pushed through a multi-ten-inch cabinet, the way juke-joint players ran cheap gear at full tilt, with a short slapback. Raw, ringing and loud. Open tunings, bottleneck or metal slide, play hard.</description>
  <tags><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Slide Blues</tag><tag>Blues</tag><tag>Slide</tag><tag>Slapback</tag><tag>No pedals</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://www.premierguitar.com/artists/forgotten-heroes/hound-dog-taylor" title="Premier Guitar: Forgotten Heroes, Hound Dog Taylor"/>
    <source url="https://www.vintageguitar.com/12131/dan-auerbach/" title="Vintage Guitar: Dan Auerbach"/>
    <source url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elmore_James" title="Elmore James (Wikipedia)"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
